# Junior Science and Humanities Symposium Management Information Booklet for School Year 1990-1991.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This booklet contains all of the information necessary to conduct and administer the annual Department of Defense Dependent Schools (DODDS) Pacific Region Junior Science and Humanities Symposium at the school level. Students are invited to conduct original experimental research in the sciences, mathematics, humanities and computer applications fields and report their findings. Administrative procedures, guidelines for presentations and judging, and other information are provided. Evaluation forms for reports and presentations, organization of reports, and research guidelines are provided in the appendices. (YP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED315295

